Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.93,0:00:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.80,0:01:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chain of vision, start and come
Dialogue: 2,0:01:30.82,0:01:35.45,Title 3,ep,0,0,0,,{\fad(776,642)\pos(197,810)\fscx(86)}Episode 15: Justice, Part 2
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.76,0:01:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Polnareff, I shall savor killing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.80,0:01:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To avenge my dear son, I shall rip\Nout your insides while you watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.66,0:01:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I can't let him find Whole Horse's\Nbody or else my chance will be lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.34,0:01:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's not behind the counter, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.72,0:01:50.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be even worse if\Nthe other three show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.58,0:01:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to kill them one by one, dammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.60,0:01:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay back. Go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.78,0:01:58.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Madame, are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.08,0:02:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I heard some\Nkind of crash back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.84,0:02:02.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.74,0:02:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming in, Madame.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.86,0:02:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.94,0:02:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.54,0:02:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only a tiny fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.38,0:02:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just bruised my hip a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.76,0:02:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fell down?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.16,0:02:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't be falling now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.48,0:02:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you burned your left hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.04,0:02:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're being much, much too careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.40,0:02:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you, dear boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.96,0:02:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.14,0:02:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No problem, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.74,0:02:40.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who said you could come in here, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.86,0:02:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll spare you my wrath for\Nnow, but when the time is right,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.92,0:02:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you just like I\Nkilled that bastard Abbacchio.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.30,0:02:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All it takes is just a tiny little wound,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.92,0:03:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then you're finished I'll turn you\Ninto my very own puppet of justice?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.74,0:03:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cool. Here your staff!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.18,0:03:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Madame, you seem to be\Nsweating a lot. It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.46,0:03:14.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't concern yourself with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.00,0:03:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine Just go to your room and\Nget some rest Well, if you insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.60,0:03:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, I was wondering, are you running\Nthe entire hotel all by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.52,0:03:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you have any family around to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.34,0:03:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like a son?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.64,0:03:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've gotten used to living alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.50,0:03:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.52,0:03:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds lonely to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.28,0:03:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just think, life with a\Nson and daughter-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.52,0:03:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your grandkids could run\Naround and play in the lobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.36,0:03:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'd definitely cheer this place up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.50,0:03:46.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd be a little noisy, but\Nthat's what makes families great!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.16,0:03:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you had a son, he'd probably\Nbe older than me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.48,0:03:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.86,0:03:55.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you have a son who\Nmoved away or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.22,0:04:00.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, he passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.84,0:04:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.78,0:04:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was terribly insensitive of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.18,0:04:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who\Nkilled him, you monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.24,0:04:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I despise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.04,0:04:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll slaughter you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.36,0:04:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll slaughter you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.28,0:04:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.46,0:04:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was still just a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.58,0:04:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't this great?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.98,0:04:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, the memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.06,0:04:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tonight you can think about me\Nas if I'm your own beloved son
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.24,0:04:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ask me for anything, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.28,0:04:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You rotten little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.52,0:04:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should just kill you\Nright now, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.40,0:04:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, your living alone has\Nbeen pretty tough on you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.82,0:04:46.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.73,0:04:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that guy doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.06,0:04:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This Card must have made his stand vanish.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.98,0:04:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as soon as it shot the bullet\Ninto his mouth! Gah! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.90,0:04:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that face!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.06,0:04:57.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.04,0:04:59.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look behind you, Paula Raff!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.88,0:05:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behind you, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.66,0:05:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.86,0:05:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're whole horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.66,0:05:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.96,0:05:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting my vengeance!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.30,0:05:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the mother of Cenderfold who you\Nmercilessly murdered in cold blood!
