Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.04,0:05:16.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chariot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.06,0:05:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're a stand-user all along!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.86,0:05:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dare play a part in murdering my boy\Nand I'll make sure you pay for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.04,0:05:25.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.95,0:05:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, I need help!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.82,0:05:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.12,0:05:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid your trusty friends will\Nnever hear your cries, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.12,0:05:34.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.28,0:05:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've summoned my own allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.54,0:05:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.36,0:05:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, it's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.82,0:05:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.20,0:05:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were dead when we got here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.22,0:05:51.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one from India!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.00,0:05:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy shit, we've got zombies!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.84,0:06:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behold the terrifying\Npower of justice, my stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.88,0:06:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One can only have one stand,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.80,0:06:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Justice the Fog Stand can transform\Nthe dead into my personal army!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.62,0:06:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can control hundreds of\Ncorpses, even thousands of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.58,0:06:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'll turn you into a personal puppet!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.86,0:06:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need only to give you a little scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.00,0:06:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't take much, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.80,0:06:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon you'll be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.24,0:06:34.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then my Stand Justice will\Ntake care of the rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.26,0:06:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're dead! Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.96,0:06:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.02,0:06:42.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, ah, ah, Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.44,0:06:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't I save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.72,0:06:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're on your own, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.14,0:06:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't escape my righteous\Nvengeance, Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.28,0:06:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll yank your brains out\Nthrough your nostrils!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.64,0:06:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll snap your spine in\Nhalf and shatter your bones!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.58,0:06:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll crush your balls till they pop!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.60,0:06:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My vengeance comes now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.26,0:06:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't possibly run so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.28,0:07:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.44,0:07:04.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.35,0:07:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That filthy coward ran into the back room!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.54,0:07:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After him, you fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.98,0:07:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Break down that door at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.22,0:07:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mare, just my luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.98,0:07:18.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This hallway leads down to the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.54,0:07:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so far away from them now. Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.22,0:07:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar and the others will never hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.50,0:07:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think those creepy\Nzombies can beat me,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.78,0:07:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if I get even a single\Nscratch, I'll be in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.30,0:07:32.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'll take control of\Nme just like Anjuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.24,0:07:33.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.32,0:07:34.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't there any way outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.68,0:07:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And of course the windows\Nhave iron bars on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.76,0:07:44.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.46,0:07:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just have to keep these freaks as\Nfar away from my skin as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.76,0:07:54.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now they're coming down the hallway.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.20,0:07:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must be checking every room. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.18,0:07:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're getting closer and closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.22,0:08:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute. Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.42,0:08:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I run into another bathroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.14,0:08:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why am I always getting\Nambushed in bathrooms?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.74,0:08:09.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.65,0:08:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The toilet is so dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.06,0:08:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, just try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.32,0:08:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the second you walk in, my chariot will\Nchop up four of you in a single breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.76,0:08:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.26,0:08:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's totally quiet out there. Creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.50,0:08:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn zombie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.44,0:08:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That old hag what the hell are they doing\Naren't they going to break down the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.70,0:08:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's taking them so long?\NCome on, do something! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.76,0:09:12.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.80,0:09:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've finally fallen under my justice's\Ncontrol, you shitty little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.50,0:09:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, if you don't open that door\Nand come out on your own this second,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.24,0:09:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to slowly crush your face\Nand pull you through the keyhole!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.44,0:09:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Laugh now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.30,0:09:42.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How pitiful, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.78,0:09:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very pitiful, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.14,0:09:53.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't even close to the level of\Ntorture you put my centerfold through.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.82,0:09:58.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of your cowardice, my precious\Nson died in unimaginable agony.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.10,0:10:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, how about we have\Nyou clean the bathroom, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.16,0:10:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sound like a plan to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.98,0:10:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lick the toilet until\Nit sparkles like noob.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.38,0:10:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.20,0:10:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lick it till it's shiny, like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.02,0:10:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.04,0:10:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not anything but that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.56,0:10:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, God, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.14,0:11:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you startled me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.70,0:11:07.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must learn to knock, my young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.66,0:11:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.32,0:11:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here looking for\NPolnareff, and I did knock.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.58,0:11:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you didn't hear me because you\Nwere too busy doing something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.04,0:11:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.94,0:11:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for Polnareff,\Nbut I can't find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.34,0:11:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seen him, Grandma?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.04,0:11:34.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.06,0:11:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.94,0:11:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unlike Polnareff,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.10,0:11:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this Jotaro is clever and knows the right\Nquestions to ask to get what he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.60,0:11:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.44,0:11:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Playing dumb will just\Nmake him more suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.78,0:11:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.76,0:11:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a troublesome brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.52,0:11:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.56,0:11:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell him where he can find Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.64,0:11:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and as soon as he turns his back, I'll\Nturn him into a pincushion with these.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.00,0:12:02.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then he'll be easy\Npickings for my justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.42,0:12:05.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course I can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.58,0:12:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know exactly where he is, Mr. Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.44,0:12:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He and I were just\Nhaving a lovely chat. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.62,0:12:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.32,0:12:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro has no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.00,0:12:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A tiny scratch will spell his doom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.60,0:12:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay back. Tell Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.52,0:12:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar and Kakyoin that hag is the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.18,0:12:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's in the bathroom, but he's\Nbeen in there for quite some time.
