Dialogue: 2,0:12:49.33,0:12:49.37,SFXBlue,3,0,0,0,,{=2}{\bord0\blur0.7\fade(255,0,255,-16350,-16349,49,50)\frz359\org(19.228,13.235)\pos(19.228,13.235)\4a&HFF&}Menacing
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.36,0:12:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What an incompetent fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.52,0:12:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are a child after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.82,0:12:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Murdering Polnareff will\Ndelight my son's soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.02,0:13:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And spilling your blood, Jotaro, will\Nsend Lord Dio in Egypt into jubilation!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.92,0:13:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.04,0:13:05.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.44,0:13:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.92,0:13:11.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.83,0:13:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.84,0:13:15.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you trip or were you just that clumsy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.42,0:13:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be more careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.30,0:13:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.42,0:13:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, could have been real bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.20,0:13:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could have gone into your eye or cut\Na huge chunk out of your scrawny neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.40,0:13:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're pretty damn lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.08,0:13:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to ask before you even get\Nup, but I have a few more questions
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.48,0:13:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First on the list, how did\Nyou know my name is Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.88,0:13:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never told you my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.60,0:13:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one has, not since we got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.42,0:13:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I find that strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.58,0:13:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, come on, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.80,0:13:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, it's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.90,0:13:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's because I\Nwatched Columbo as a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.24,0:13:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's little details like\Nthat that keep me up at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.96,0:13:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're beginning to hurt\Nthis old lady's feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.66,0:14:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the guest book.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.26,0:14:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wrote your name in\Nthe guest book earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.76,0:14:04.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you don't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.94,0:14:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.48,0:14:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wrote Jotaro Kujo, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.30,0:14:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, then I guess you mean\Nthis guest book here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.14,0:14:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.68,0:14:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, your name is right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.26,0:14:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro Kujo?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.50,0:14:27.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro isn't ridden\Nanywhere in this old thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.54,0:14:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calling me Joestar when we first\Nmet was your first mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.76,0:14:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've suspected you since.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.60,0:14:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told the others not to use my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.82,0:14:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet, you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.70,0:14:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which could only mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.60,0:14:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut the crap, you old hag!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.88,0:14:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I already know you're one of\Nthe stand users that's after us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.40,0:14:47.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The jig is up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.08,0:14:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.02,0:14:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you going to show\Nme your stand and fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.00,0:15:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're looking right at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.64,0:15:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.88,0:15:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stand justice always prevails!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.38,0:15:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All it needs is one small scratch, and\Nthen your life is as good as forfeit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.68,0:15:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've fallen into my trap, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.50,0:15:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pull the riff!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.96,0:15:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, it's me, Haw Horse, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.72,0:15:46.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Yaba's stand is made\Nentirely out of fog!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.54,0:15:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll split your wound right open\Nand start flowing through your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.66,0:15:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how she controls you with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.94,0:15:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll even control corpses!
