Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.44,0:16:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you punch the fog with your fist?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.18,0:16:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or cut the fog with your sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.86,0:16:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or shoot it with a gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.88,0:16:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.40,0:16:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Absolutely futile!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.90,0:16:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing you can\Ndo but accept your fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.56,0:16:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the biggest, toughest,\Nfiercest stand there is!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.40,0:16:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ours are puny, by comparison.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.44,0:16:23.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're no match for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.22,0:16:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing stands a chance\Nagainst justice. Lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.60,0:16:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep it coming, whole horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.50,0:16:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your fearful praise is music to my ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.54,0:16:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'll control you too, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.74,0:16:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quick, run away, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.04,0:16:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's gonna turn you into a puppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.06,0:16:44.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.18,0:16:45.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.88,0:16:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before that old hag takes another breath,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.06,0:16:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll defeat that stand and send\Nher back in. Huh? What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.70,0:16:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could have sworn you just made some\Nidiotic proclamation about defeating me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.64,0:16:58.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.72,0:17:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before I take another\Nbreath, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.34,0:17:02.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.46,0:17:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.44,0:17:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.32,0:17:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Totoro's star platinum is\Nsucking in her entire stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.14,0:17:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.08,0:17:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.70,0:17:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.62,0:17:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he's holding it in!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.68,0:17:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's suffocating that bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.06,0:17:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmph, you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.40,0:17:53.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like her head is in a bit of a fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.90,0:17:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ask me, that's justice at its finest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.60,0:17:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.20,0:18:06.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, what\Nhave I been licking?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.46,0:18:08.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ask such stupid questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.36,0:18:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I honestly don't see why that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.68,0:18:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.02,0:18:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were licking what again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.20,0:18:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't hear you very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.70,0:18:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who cares what it was?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.02,0:18:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I need to disinfect my tongue, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.30,0:18:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me the medicine already!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.06,0:18:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I just heard the word toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.16,0:18:26.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you giggling about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.48,0:18:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I already knew about that,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.74,0:18:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I couldn't resist picking\Non him about this first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.34,0:18:34.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.30,0:18:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro already told you\Nwhat happened, didn't he?
