Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.48,0:18:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget the medicine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.80,0:18:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, all right, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.94,0:18:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come here and I'll fix you up, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.90,0:18:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't take care of\Nthat, it'll get infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.64,0:18:50.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahem!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.84,0:18:51.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.04,0:18:52.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahem!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.95,0:18:54.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You licked it real good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.10,0:18:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojaro, cocky-wee!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.54,0:18:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's just get\Nthe hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.42,0:19:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, come outside. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.96,0:19:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What on earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.74,0:19:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We step outside of the\Nhotel and this place is a...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.08,0:19:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.66,0:19:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was using her stand's fog to make this\Ngraveyard look like a town and a hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.58,0:19:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the whole time we were here, we were\Ntalking to some corpses six feet under?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.02,0:19:37.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wanna take her with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.98,0:19:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.94,0:19:40.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.50,0:19:44.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to know how many more\NStan users are out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.34,0:19:45.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What their powers are?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.80,0:19:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And wherever Dio's dug a\Nhole for himself in Egypt?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.30,0:19:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as well as what his power is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.66,0:19:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we get the hag to tell us, it might\Nfinally give us the edge that we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.52,0:19:59.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's worth the risk\Nof dragging her around.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.28,0:20:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I highly doubt she'll be willing\Nto share that information, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.72,0:20:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just need to use my hermit, Purple.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.70,0:20:09.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll project everything she's\Nthinking onto a TV screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.62,0:20:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.02,0:20:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll hop over to the next\Ntown and use a TV there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.56,0:20:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hull horse, you slide\Nball! That's our car!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.20,0:20:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.20,0:20:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sticking with Dio after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.94,0:20:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Catch y 'all later.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.32,0:20:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Provided you all don't\Ndie before then, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.02,0:20:29.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little advice for y 'all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.70,0:20:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better put a bullet between\Nthat old lady's eyes real
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.34,0:20:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,soon or else you'll find out just\Nhow terrifying Dio really is!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.58,0:20:38.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you do not want that!
