Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.45,0:20:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.54,0:20:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does anyone know what he's talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.84,0:20:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause I don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.30,0:21:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the old paintings on the tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.10,0:21:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They do the sand dance, don't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.14,0:21:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they move too quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.70,0:21:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're falling down like a domino.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.80,0:21:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the birds are men by the Nile.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.48,0:21:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've got the money on a bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.50,0:21:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Called crocodiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.12,0:21:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They snap their teeth on your cigarette.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.10,0:21:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Foreign types with a hookah. I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.68,0:21:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.92,0:21:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blonde waitresses take their trays.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.10,0:21:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spin around and they cross the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.10,0:21:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've got the moves, oh-hey-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.62,0:21:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You drop your drink,\Nthen they bring you more.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.76,0:22:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the school kids are so sick of books.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.40,0:22:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're like the punk and the metal band.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.46,0:22:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the buzzer rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.76,0:22:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're walking like an Egyptian.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.70,0:22:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the kids in the marketplace say.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.36,0:22:11.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walk
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.27,0:22:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.64,0:22:15.06,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the old paintings on the tomb
Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.06,0:22:17.31,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They do the sand dance, don'tcha know?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.31,0:22:18.77,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,If they move too quick
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.44,0:22:19.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an Egyptian.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.56,0:22:22.02,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They're falling down like a domino
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.02,0:22:24.36,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the bazaar men by the Nile
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.76,0:22:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.20,0:22:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could you want with me?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.36,0:22:26.70,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They got the money on a bet
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.34,0:22:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Dio truly trusts no one.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.70,0:22:28.20,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Gold crocodiles
